-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SCOPE

The licence above covers the source code in this repository: `pricing_dt/`,
`tests/`, `benchmark_minigrid/` and the top-level scripts. It also covers the build
and check scripts that stay with the dissertation sources, which are not distributed
in this package.

It does not cover:

  * The dissertation text, its figures, and its appendices. These are the
    author's academic work and are not released under the MIT terms.

  * The real transaction data. No copy of it is distributed here: it is
    downloaded at run time from the UCI Machine Learning Repository (Online
    Retail II, dataset id 502, DOI 10.24432/C5CG6D), which publishes it under
    Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International. Aggregate quantities
    derived from it appear in the result CSVs and carry that attribution
    requirement with them. See Appendix H.3.

  * The public benchmark used by the pre-registered external replication, which
    carries its own licence; see `benchmark_minigrid/`.
